===Etymology===
{{borrowing|rom|wangar||coal|lang=en}}, from {{etyl|sa|en}} {{m|sa|अङ्गार|tr=áṅgāra||charcoal, coal}}, from {{etyl|iir-pro|en}} {{m|iir-pro|*Hangāra-}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|en}} {{m|ine-pro|*h₁ongʷl-}}. The English term {{m|en|coal}} was itself used as a slang term for money in England in the 18th and 19th century.

